lting work  this month coming up as well my schedule  is pretty full but if you're interested  in tutorials or philosophical counseling  you can email me directly at reason IO  or Greg at reason IO comm or just go to  the reason IO site and check those  services out the other thing that I'm  going to be doing and spending a lot of  time on this month is class preparation  I've been asked to teach two classes at  Marquette University in the fall two  different classes as it turns out one is  you know sort of the revised intro level  class and the other is a business ethics  class and I'm also going to be teaching  for the Milwaukee Institute of Art and  Design a class specifically on  philosophy of human nature set up for  arts and design students so I got to do  a lot of thinking about exactly which  texts and thinkers and how to do  assignments and all the other  mystics involved with that so that's  gonna be something I'm gonna try to  knock out this this coming month what  else is there to talk about well my kids  are gonna be here for a week this month  so it was a weekend last month and now  it's gonna be a week and we're gonna  spend some great time together I'm still  doing my you know workouts  feeling great effects from from that but  I'll also be doing a lot of video work  I'm hoping to get my my quota of six  half-hour hagel videos done and maybe  even sooner than later this month  a lot of Heidegger's stuff yet to  release and the Play Doh stuff that I  produced and released ahead of time to  my patreon supporters that still has to  be released I've got some Q&amp;A videos  lined up and I've got an interview that  I'm hoping all released tomorrow with a  good friend and colleague here in the  area and then the event videos you can  expect to see them and I'm gonna be  doing more book reviews I've gotten a  little bit behind and the books are  really piling up as people keep sending  them in to me so I think I need to start  cranking those out maybe do on